      "result_description": "Three Bridges CC - 1st XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "24926",
      "match_notes": "<p>The&nbsp;Home&nbsp;team&nbsp;failed&nbsp;to&nbsp;bowl&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;required&nbsp;overate,&nbsp;Playing&nbsp;Conditions&nbsp;L3.7&nbsp;and&nbsp;have&nbsp;been&nbsp;docked&nbsp;2&nbsp;penalty&nbsp;runs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Details&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;over&nbsp;rate&nbsp;point&nbsp;deduction&nbsp;for&nbsp;Bognor&nbsp;Regis.&nbsp;All&nbsp;timings&nbsp;based&nbsp;on&nbsp;pavilion&nbsp;clock</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Innings&nbsp;commenced&nbsp;at&nbsp;11:31am&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;conclusion&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;58&nbsp;overs&nbsp;were&nbsp;bowled&nbsp;at&nbsp;3:36pm.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Total&nbsp;playing&nbsp;time&nbsp;245&nbsp;minutes,&nbsp;less&nbsp;10&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;for&nbsp;drinks&nbsp;breaks&nbsp;(at&nbsp;17&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;34&nbsp;overs),&nbsp;less&nbsp;deductions&nbsp;at&nbsp;umpire&nbsp;discretion&nbsp;10&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;(multiple&nbsp;left/right&nbsp;batter&nbsp;combinations,&nbsp;batter&nbsp;delays&nbsp;and&nbsp;extra&nbsp;drink&nbsp;for&nbsp;batter).&nbsp;There&nbsp;were&nbsp;no&nbsp;other&nbsp;delays&nbsp;for&nbsp;lost&nbsp;balls&nbsp;etc&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;innings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Therefore,&nbsp;245&nbsp;-&nbsp;10&nbsp;-10&nbsp;=&nbsp;225&nbsp;net&nbsp;playing&nbsp;time</p>\r\n\r\n<p>58&nbsp;/&nbsp;225&nbsp;=&nbsp;0.257&nbsp;x&nbsp;60&nbsp;min&nbsp;=&nbsp;15.5&nbsp;overs&nbsp;per&nbsp;hour.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bognor&nbsp;Regis&nbsp;bowled&nbsp;50&nbsp;overs&nbsp;of&nbsp;pace&nbsp;and&nbsp;only&nbsp;8&nbsp;overs&nbsp;on&nbsp;spin.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Although&nbsp;there&nbsp;was&nbsp;no&nbsp;deliberate&nbsp;slowness&nbsp;in&nbsp;play&nbsp;by&nbsp;Bognor&nbsp;Regis,&nbsp;the&nbsp;use&nbsp;of&nbsp;pace&nbsp;bowlers&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;initial&nbsp;30&nbsp;overs&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;game&nbsp;set&nbsp;the&nbsp;tempo&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;innings.</p>\r\n",
